{
  "words": [
    {
      "word": "In March 1962, America's most senior general signed a plan to stage attacks on Americans, and blame them on Cuba.",
      "offsetSec": 0.0,
      "durationSec": 6.34,
      "frame": 0
    },
    {
      "word": "It sounds like a conspiracy theory.",
      "offsetSec": 7.0,
      "durationSec": 1.5,
      "frame": 210
    },
    {
      "word": "Keep that phrase in mind.",
      "offsetSec": 9.02,
      "durationSec": 0.94,
      "frame": 271
    },
    {
      "word": "Cuba sits just ninety miles from Florida, and Fidel Castro had turned it into a communist ally of the Soviet Union.",
      "offsetSec": 10.9,
      "durationSec": 5.24,
      "frame": 327
    },
    {
      "word": "A year earlier, a CIA-backed invasion at the Bay of Pigs had collapsed in three days.",
      "offsetSec": 16.66,
      "durationSec": 4.16,
      "frame": 500
    },
    {
      "word": "Washington still wanted Castro gone.",
      "offsetSec": 21.48,
      "durationSec": 1.62,
      "frame": 644
    },
    {
      "word": "What it needed was a reason the world would accept.",
      "offsetSec": 23.6,
      "durationSec": 2.0,
      "frame": 708
    },
    {
      "word": "So the Joint Chiefs of Staff wrote a memo, titled \"Justification for US Military Intervention in Cuba.\" Here are some of its ideas.",
      "offsetSec": 26.48,
      "durationSec": 6.5,
      "frame": 794
    },
    {
      "word": "Friendly Cubans in Cuban uniforms would stage an attack on the US base at Guantanamo.",
      "offsetSec": 33.94,
      "durationSec": 3.5,
      "frame": 1018
    },
    {
      "word": "A US ship could be blown up in Guantanamo Bay, with Cuba blamed.",
      "offsetSec": 38.14,
      "durationSec": 3.02,
      "frame": 1144
    },
    {
      "word": "The memo calls it a \"Remember the Maine\" incident, after the explosion that helped start America's war with Spain in 1898.",
      "offsetSec": 41.74,
      "durationSec": 5.36,
      "frame": 1252
    },
    {
      "word": "A \"Communist Cuban terror campaign\" in Miami, in other Florida cities, and even in Washington.",
      "offsetSec": 47.94,
      "durationSec": 4.82,
      "frame": 1438
    },
    {
      "word": "A boatload of Cuban refugees sunk on its way to Florida, \"real or simulated.\" An airliner swapped for an empty drone, so it could be \"shot down,\" with a Cuban jet taking the blame.",
      "offsetSec": 53.42,
      "durationSec": 9.28,
      "frame": 1603
    },
    {
      "word": "And one line explains the thinking: \"Casualty lists in US newspapers would cause a helpful wave of national indignation.\" General Lyman Lemnitzer, chairman of the Joint Chiefs, sent it to the Secretary of Defense on March 13th.",
      "offsetSec": 63.54,
      "durationSec": 12.62,
      "frame": 1906
    },
    {
      "word": "Three days later, at a White House meeting with Lemnitzer in the room, President Kennedy said he doubted anything would justify sending in American forces.",
      "offsetSec": 76.2,
      "durationSec": 6.1,
      "frame": 2286
    },
    {
      "word": "Nothing was approved, and none of it was carried out.",
      "offsetSec": 83.02,
      "durationSec": 1.98,
      "frame": 2491
    },
    {
      "word": "That fall, Lemnitzer's term as chairman ended, and he was sent to Europe to command NATO's forces.",
      "offsetSec": 85.58,
      "durationSec": 4.02,
      "frame": 2567
    },
    {
      "word": "For thirty-five years, the memo stayed locked away.",
      "offsetSec": 90.44,
      "durationSec": 2.0,
      "frame": 2713
    },
    {
      "word": "Then in 1997, a board set up to release the Kennedy assassination records made it public, along with about fifteen hundred other pages.",
      "offsetSec": 93.06,
      "durationSec": 6.2,
      "frame": 2792
    },
    {
      "word": "The scary part isn't that it was stopped.",
      "offsetSec": 99.98,
      "durationSec": 1.62,
      "frame": 2999
    },
    {
      "word": "It's that it was typed up, signed, and sent up the chain like ordinary paperwork.",
      "offsetSec": 102.04,
      "durationSec": 3.8,
      "frame": 3061
    },
    {
      "word": "So, a conspiracy theory?",
      "offsetSec": 106.72,
      "durationSec": 1.34,
      "frame": 3202
    },
    {
      "word": "Not this one.",
      "offsetSec": 108.52,
      "durationSec": 0.58,
      "frame": 3256
    },
    {
      "word": "You can read it in the National Archives.",
      "offsetSec": 109.44,
      "durationSec": 1.56,
      "frame": 3283
    }
  ],
